# (build 89a) The door Espers after the party comes back upstairs.
# Obj_MovingEsper's init (ps2.asm 7604, loc_532C), with $C742 already
# set: routine 4 at x $118 and frame 6 for the one placed at $110, x $E8
# and frame 9 for the other -- half a cell out from the doorway, facing
# each other, not south as right after their step on first entry
# (esper_door's 02_stepped_aside). The owner confirmed it in the emulator
# after build 89 (back up the stairs from B1). A picture check: the probe
# has no expect on an object's place or frame, so 01_facing_in and the
# objects line are the evidence.

start level $10 15 15
flag $C742 1
wait idle
walk up 2                    # onto B1's stairs, 15,13
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $11 15 14
objects
shot 01_facing_in
# The line above: $30 at cell 14,27 on frame 9 and at 17,27 on frame 6
# ($E8 and $118). The door is off the bottom of that frame; F1 entered
# again by warp, the same init, puts the camera on the doorway.
warp $11 15 25
wait screen level
wait idle
objects
shot 02_doorway
